{"updated":"2026-11-25T04:23:56.114Z","text":"Good evening, sir. Over the last twenty-four hours, the story leading the world is this: Australian politics live: Two Nationals kicked out of question time as Taylor slams ‘dirty deal’ with Greens; NSW responds to fire ant threat in Sydney. Elsewhere, amnesty calls for ICC genocide probe over Israel's impact on births in Gaza. And colombia’s president arrives at scene of supermarket hostage siege in tourist city. All of which keeps the conflict picture centred on Ukraine, at active conflict levels, though US, and Iran are worth keeping an eye on as well. The markets, for their part, felt the weight of it — the S&P 500 down 5.5 percent, the Dow Jones Industrial down 4.2 percent, and the Nasdaq Composite down 8.6 percent. The earth itself has been busier, with 51 tremors above magnitude two and a half — the strongest a 6.4 near Mauritius - Reunion region. And overhead, space weather is calm — nothing of concern. That is the shape of the day, sir. The board is yours.","times":[0,0.12,0.16,0.21,0.24,0.29,0.34,0.38,0.42,0.46,0.51,0.53,0.56,0.59,0.61,0.66,0.78,0.87,1.04,1.32,1.44,1.49,1.52,1.54,1.59,1.61,1.64,1.66,1.71,1.75,1.82,1.89,1.94,1.96,2.01,2.06,2.1,2.13,2.17,2.22,2.26,2.3,2.35,2.39,2.44,2.48,2.53,2.59,2.66,2.73,2.84,2.96,3.11,3.13,3.18,3.2,3.26,3.31,3.37,3.48,3.56,3.62,3.69,3.74,3.8,3.84,3.89,3.94,3.96,3.99,4.04,4.06,4.09,4.11,4.16,4.2,4.28,4.34,4.41,4.5,4.56,4.66,4.7,4.76,4.78,4.85,4.97,5.1,5.27,5.65,5.75,5.82,5.85,5.9,5.97,6.03,6.08,6.14,6.19,6.22,6.29,6.34,6.4,6.47,6.53,6.58,6.65,6.72,6.78,6.86,6.92,7.04,7.09,7.25,7.33,7.57,7.66,7.72,7.79,7.87,7.92,8.01,8.07,8.12,8.16,8.21,8.27,8.32,8.39,8.46,8.52,8.58,8.63,8.66,8.7,8.72,8.77,8.82,8.88,8.93,8.97,9.01,9.03,9.11,9.16,9.2,9.26,9.31,9.37,9.41,9.46,9.51,9.58,9.64,9.79,9.85,10.02,10.11,10.23,10.27,10.34,10.39,10.47,10.52,10.58,10.62,10.66,10.7,10.76,10.84,10.97,11.05,11.13,11.16,11.2,11.25,11.34,11.4,11.47,11.53,11.59,11.63,11.71,11.78,11.84,11.89,11.92,11.96,12,12.04,1